# Metroid Dread 2.1.0 - test c: no-op. Rewrites the camera-only addresses with
# their ORIGINAL bytes. If the game crashes with only this enabled, the crash is
# in how the mod is loaded, not in what the patch changes.

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

@enabled
00E94F20 28C79152
00E94F24 68FCA772
@stop
